    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "64058c8",
      "content": "<strong>  9.8 Reading Comprehension — Practice</strong>"
    },
    {
      "id": "cfkfpp3",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>[ Read the passage and answer the questions ]</strong></p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Artificial Intelligence (AI) is transforming every sector of the global economy. From healthcare to agriculture, from education to governance, AI-powered solutions are reshaping how humans live and work. Machine learning algorithms can now diagnose diseases with greater accuracy than trained doctors and predict weather patterns months in advance. India has recognized the enormous potential of AI and launched the National AI Strategy in 2018. The government's focus on AI for social good — including applications in agriculture, healthcare, and smart cities — distinguishes India's approach. However, concerns about job displacement, algorithmic bias, and data privacy must be addressed through thoughtful regulation.</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "unmv5ag",
      "content": "<strong>Q.1. </strong>What is the main theme of the passage?"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "d62ic3g",
      "content": "<strong>  (A) </strong>History of AI"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "zt0iom1",
      "content": "<strong>  (B) </strong>Transformative impact of AI and India's approach"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "dek5rof",
      "content": "<strong>  (C) </strong>AI and job loss only"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "vw9aakl",
      "content": "<strong>  (D) </strong>AI in education only"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "9aeqey2",
      "content": "<strong>  Ans: (B) Transformative impact of AI and India's approach   Explanation: </strong><em>The passage covers AI's broad impact across sectors and specifically highlights India's National AI Strategy.</em>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "is4tcpk",
      "content": "<strong>Q.2. </strong>India launched its National AI Strategy in:"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "977ng4u",
      "content": "<strong>  (A) </strong>2015"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "22p5jp4",
      "content": "<strong>  (B) </strong>2017"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "8itbrpi",
      "content": "<strong>  (C) </strong>2018"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "0bya3wk",
      "content": "<strong>  (D) </strong>2020"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "timrgsr",
      "content": "<strong>  Ans: (C) 2018   Explanation: </strong><em>The passage clearly states: 'India launched the National AI Strategy in 2018.'</em>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "c8x47ik",
      "content": "<strong>Q.3. </strong>The word 'displacement' in the context of jobs means:"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "2e3hd9y",
      "content": "<strong>  (A) </strong>Creates new jobs"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "9rf7vxy",
      "content": "<strong>  (B) </strong>Forces out/eliminates existing jobs"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "u1e9lxi",
      "content": "<strong>  (C) </strong>Improves jobs"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "o260cii",
      "content": "<strong>  (D) </strong>Transfers jobs overseas"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "xn8z8c1",
      "content": "<strong>  Ans: (B) Forces out/eliminates existing jobs   Explanation: </strong><em>'Job displacement' refers to AI eliminating or replacing existing jobs — a concern mentioned in the passage.</em>"
    }
  ],
  "enriched": true
}